      "problem_text": "A function is defined by $f(x) = 8\\sin x + 15\\cos x$. Express $f(x)$ in the form $R\\sin(x + \\alpha)$ and find the maximum value of $f(x)$ and the smallest positive $x$ at which it occurs.",
